WEBVTT

1
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.833
In these verses of Chapter 11, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.000
now speaks about the rarity

3
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.791
of His two-armed form.

4
00:00:56.791 --> 00:00:58.583
Even the devas, who possess

5
00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:01.500
immense power and spiritual vision,

6
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.458
long to see this form,

7
00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:07.708
yet cannot easily behold it.

8
00:01:07.708 --> 00:01:10.791
This form cannot be obtained through Vedic study,

9
00:01:10.791 --> 00:01:12.291
sacrifice, charity,

10
00:01:12.291 --> 00:01:14.791
or austerity.

11
00:01:14.791 --> 00:01:18.000
It requires devotion.

12
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.166
Devotion, which is superior to all other

13
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:23.666
spiritual practices.

14
00:01:28.791 --> 00:01:31.416
Lord Krishna tells Arjun that the form

15
00:01:31.416 --> 00:01:33.208
he is now seeing

16
00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:35.750
is His original human-like form.

17
00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:36.625
He says

18
00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:39.625
this original form is the most difficult to behold.

19
00:01:39.625 --> 00:01:43.291
Even the devas, considered to
be at a very high level,

20
00:01:43.291 --> 00:01:46.708
long to see this divine form.

21
00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:49.333
This makes clear that although

22
00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:53.125
the Vishwarupa was grand and wonderful,

23
00:01:53.125 --> 00:01:55.041
it does not reveal the supreme

24
00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:56.750
form of the Lord.

25
00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:58.250
Lord Krishna's two-armed

26
00:01:58.250 --> 00:01:59.791
form is the true

27
00:01:59.791 --> 00:02:02.291
and eternal reality.

28
00:02:02.291 --> 00:02:05.708
He then explains that traditional spiritual

29
00:02:05.708 --> 00:02:09.625
practices, studying the Vedas,
austerity, charity,

30
00:02:09.625 --> 00:02:11.125
and religious worship,

31
00:02:11.125 --> 00:02:13.250
are not sufficient to grant a vision

32
00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.833
of His supreme form.

33
00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:16.083
These activities

34
00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:17.750
can lead to righteousness, knowledge,

35
00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:21.333
and even mystical experiences,

36
00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:22.916
but they do not reveal 

37
00:02:22.916 --> 00:02:24.500
the essence of Lord Krishna.

38
00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:27.958
Only through devotion, pure love,

39
00:02:27.958 --> 00:02:32.875
can one see Him as He truly is.

40
00:02:32.875 --> 00:02:33.833
This teaching

41
00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:35.291
refutes the belief

42
00:02:35.291 --> 00:02:36.375
of those who consider

43
00:02:36.375 --> 00:02:39.250
the Supreme Lord to be only formless

44
00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.791
and regard His form as lesser,

45
00:02:41.791 --> 00:02:43.416
refuting it

46
00:02:43.416 --> 00:02:46.500
and giving us the correct understanding.

47
00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.708
Lord Krishna makes clear

48
00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:51.291
that seeing Him is not a first step,

49
00:02:51.291 --> 00:02:54.458
but the highest spiritual achievement.

50
00:02:54.458 --> 00:02:56.625
This comes not through thinking

51
00:02:56.625 --> 00:02:59.458
or ritual alone,

52
00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:02.541
but through true love and surrender.

53
00:03:02.541 --> 00:03:04.583
Thus Arjun's ability to see Lord Krishna's

54
00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:06.833
personal form

55
00:03:06.833 --> 00:03:08.916
is not the result of his efforts,

56
00:03:08.916 --> 00:03:11.458
but the gift of His grace,

57
00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:12.791
showing

58
00:03:12.791 --> 00:03:16.250
that devotion alone is the true means

59
00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.958
of knowing the Supreme Lord.

60
00:03:23.708 --> 00:03:25.791
Notice this:

61
00:03:25.791 --> 00:03:27.291
how often

62
00:03:27.291 --> 00:03:31.708
do you overlook the blessings

63
00:03:31.708 --> 00:03:36.791
that surround you every day?

64
00:03:36.791 --> 00:03:38.750
Just as Arjun

65
00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:40.916
had been seeing

66
00:03:40.916 --> 00:03:45.625
My two-armed form for a long time,

67
00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:51.625
yet did not grasp its rarity,

68
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:53.916
in the same way, it is possible

69
00:03:53.916 --> 00:03:57.833
that you too do not fully

70
00:03:57.833 --> 00:04:01.916
honour that which

71
00:04:01.916 --> 00:04:05.083
is closest to you,

72
00:04:05.083 --> 00:04:07.500
because its value

73
00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:11.333
becomes clear only when it is gone.

74
00:04:11.333 --> 00:04:14.416
The comfort of your home,

75
00:04:14.416 --> 00:04:16.916
the love of your family,

76
00:04:16.916 --> 00:04:20.541
the opportunities that come into your life,

77
00:04:20.541 --> 00:04:24.833
these do not arrive by chance.

78
00:04:24.833 --> 00:04:31.500
They are gifts far more precious

79
00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:34.375
than you realise.

80
00:04:34.375 --> 00:04:37.416
Taking blessings for granted

81
00:04:37.416 --> 00:04:41.625
is the greatest reason for losing the joy

82
00:04:41.625 --> 00:04:46.916
they bring.

83
00:04:46.916 --> 00:04:50.833
Before feeling sad about what you lack,

84
00:04:50.833 --> 00:04:54.500
pause for a moment

85
00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:56.250
and pay attention

86
00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:59.125
to what is already

87
00:04:59.125 --> 00:05:02.916
abundantly present

88
00:05:02.916 --> 00:05:04.833
in your life,

89
00:05:04.833 --> 00:05:08.250
what seems ordinary to you.

90
00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:09.458
Someone else

91
00:05:09.458 --> 00:05:13.666
is praying for it.

92
00:05:13.666 --> 00:05:15.916
However much you have,

93
00:05:15.916 --> 00:05:20.541
gratitude makes it enough.

94
00:05:20.541 --> 00:05:25.375
And when you begin to
honour whatever you have,

95
00:05:25.375 --> 00:05:28.875
however much it may be,

96
00:05:28.875 --> 00:05:33.125
then grace and blessings begin to

97
00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:35.708
pour down upon you.

98
00:05:35.708 --> 00:05:37.541
So reflect on this:

99
00:05:37.541 --> 00:05:41.416
open your eyes and look carefully

100
00:05:41.416 --> 00:05:43.583
at the good fortune

101
00:05:43.583 --> 00:05:47.291
already in your life.

102
00:05:47.291 --> 00:05:50.291
Cherishing this good fortune,

103
00:05:50.291 --> 00:05:54.166
you will find that life itself

104
00:05:54.166 --> 00:05:57.166
is a priceless gift.

105
00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.708
Tell me,

106
00:06:04.708 --> 00:06:06.208
do you also

107
00:06:06.208 --> 00:06:07.708
overlook

108
00:06:07.708 --> 00:06:11.166
what you have in abundance, and deeply

109
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:14.833
yearn for what is far from you?

110
00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:18.958
In families, it is easy

111
00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:22.625
to take each other for granted.

112
00:06:22.625 --> 00:06:26.541
Just as Arjun saw My two-armed

113
00:06:26.541 --> 00:06:30.958
form for so long,

114
00:06:30.958 --> 00:06:35.541
without understanding how rare it was,

115
00:06:35.541 --> 00:06:37.250
in the same way, you too

116
00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.458
may not value those around you

117
00:06:40.458 --> 00:06:44.875
until circumstances

118
00:06:44.875 --> 00:06:47.958
change.

119
00:06:47.958 --> 00:06:51.916
The affection and security given by parents,

120
00:06:51.916 --> 00:06:57.000
the support of siblings,
or the presence of a life partner,

121
00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.750
these are not ordinary things.

122
00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.708
Ask about their value from those

123
00:07:03.708 --> 00:07:07.500
in whose lives this affection, security, support,

124
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:11.416
and companionship are absent.

125
00:07:11.416 --> 00:07:17.208
They long for these deeply.

126
00:07:17.208 --> 00:07:19.708
When you assume

127
00:07:19.708 --> 00:07:24.500
that love, kindness, or
support will always be there,

128
00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.625
remember that

129
00:07:26.625 --> 00:07:31.166
you invite the risk of losing the depth

130
00:07:31.166 --> 00:07:34.250
of those relationships.

131
00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.833
Do not wait for an unfortunate event

132
00:07:36.833 --> 00:07:39.583
to remind you of what

133
00:07:39.583 --> 00:07:42.541
was precious.

134
00:07:42.541 --> 00:07:46.791
Express gratitude right now.

135
00:07:46.791 --> 00:07:50.208
Appreciate even the smallest act of love

136
00:07:50.208 --> 00:07:52.916
from the heart.

137
00:07:52.916 --> 00:07:55.916
Relationships flourish only

138
00:07:55.916 --> 00:07:58.250
when they are nourished with gratitude

139
00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:01.083
and recognition.

140
00:08:01.083 --> 00:08:02.041
When you

141
00:08:02.041 --> 00:08:06.666
stop taking each other for granted,

142
00:08:06.666 --> 00:08:09.666
every moment spent together

143
00:08:09.666 --> 00:08:12.666
becomes more meaningful,

144
00:08:12.666 --> 00:08:17.250
and love deepens so much

145
00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:21.500
that you could never have imagined it.

146
00:08:26.291 --> 00:08:30.500
Do you feel that in professional life,

147
00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.750
you can succeed every time
on your own strength alone

148
00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:37.958
without the support of anyone's wisdom?

149
00:08:37.958 --> 00:08:39.833
On your professional journey,

150
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:42.666
there are some insights and lessons

151
00:08:42.666 --> 00:08:47.291
you cannot find through effort alone.

152
00:08:47.291 --> 00:08:50.958
Just as Arjun could not see My divine form

153
00:08:50.958 --> 00:08:54.416
without my grace,

154
00:08:54.416 --> 00:08:55.416
in the same way,

155
00:08:55.416 --> 00:08:59.625
you too, for your own true growth,

156
00:08:59.625 --> 00:09:01.916
need the guidance

157
00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:04.541
and wisdom of others.

158
00:09:04.541 --> 00:09:07.625
Experience is a teacher

159
00:09:07.625 --> 00:09:09.416
that cannot be found

160
00:09:09.416 --> 00:09:12.833
in haste or impatience.

161
00:09:12.833 --> 00:09:16.916
The perspective of mentors
and seasoned experts

162
00:09:16.916 --> 00:09:19.583
often opens your eyes

163
00:09:19.583 --> 00:09:21.958
and shows you

164
00:09:21.958 --> 00:09:25.708
what you could not see alone,

165
00:09:25.708 --> 00:09:30.708
however skilled or knowledgeable you may be.

166
00:09:30.708 --> 00:09:32.833
There will be moments

167
00:09:32.833 --> 00:09:34.166
when you need

168
00:09:34.166 --> 00:09:38.750
another's perspective to understand

169
00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:42.958
the bigger picture of a plan.

170
00:09:42.958 --> 00:09:44.375
Wisdom

171
00:09:44.375 --> 00:09:47.291
is often shared,

172
00:09:47.291 --> 00:09:52.000
not discovered alone.

173
00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:55.166
That is why seeking advice,

174
00:09:55.166 --> 00:09:57.875
learning from colleagues,

175
00:09:57.875 --> 00:10:01.250
and observing the experience of those

176
00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:05.583
who have already walked this path,

177
00:10:05.583 --> 00:10:09.166
is essential for growth.

178
00:10:09.166 --> 00:10:11.875
Do not hesitate to seek guidance

179
00:10:11.875 --> 00:10:15.500
or to work alongside

180
00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:18.208
those who have come

181
00:10:18.208 --> 00:10:23.208
before you on this journey.

182
00:10:23.208 --> 00:10:24.833
Reflect on this.

183
00:10:24.833 --> 00:10:28.750
True success comes when your efforts

184
00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:31.291
are joined with the wisdom

185
00:10:31.291 --> 00:10:33.500
and perspective of those around you.

186
00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.125
That is why

187
00:10:35.125 --> 00:10:37.166
seeking advice,

188
00:10:37.166 --> 00:10:39.958
learning from colleagues,

189
00:10:39.958 --> 00:10:43.583
and observing the experience of those

190
00:10:43.583 --> 00:10:48.083
who have already walked this path,

191
00:10:48.083 --> 00:10:50.333
is essential for growth.

192
00:10:50.333 --> 00:10:52.875
Do not hesitate to seek guidance,

193
00:10:52.875 --> 00:10:55.166
or to work alongside

194
00:10:55.166 --> 00:10:58.541
those

195
00:10:58.541 --> 00:11:03.541
who have come before you on this path.

196
00:11:03.541 --> 00:11:05.958
Reflect on this:

197
00:11:05.958 --> 00:11:09.416
true success comes

198
00:11:09.416 --> 00:11:11.541
when your efforts

199
00:11:11.541 --> 00:11:15.708
are joined with the wisdom

200
00:11:15.708 --> 00:11:19.041
and perspective of those around you.
